# The `*.png` trap, fourth occurrence — see the repo-root `.gitignore`, which records the first
# three (react-rpg's 219 sprites, the tanks team-colour textures, the template's ground texture).
# The root rule ignores every `*.png` in the repo, so a vendored ANALYSIS FIXTURE that tracks
# upstream art byte-for-byte silently loses those bytes at commit time and turns up MISSING in a
# fresh checkout — which is exactly what `../../verify-unaltered.mjs` fails on.
#
# The exception lives HERE rather than in the root file because it is exactly as wide as the shelf
# that needs it: every directory under `test/fixtures/` is an unaltered upstream tree whose whole
# content is pinned by sha256 in its `<id>.UPSTREAM.lock`. Nothing else in this package tracks a
# binary.
!**/*.png
